  "review_notes": "PASS: (1) No lookahead — simulate_dca() uses prices[i] for purchase at each month-end, final valuation at prices[-1]; (2) 0050 splice correct — factor=cur/prev applied to all prior prices, preserving internal daily returns; (3) DCA math correct — accumulated shares × final price; IRR bisection 200 iterations converges; (4) Volatility drag = arithmetic − geometric mean of full calendar year returns, correct formula; (5) TWII proxy fully disclosed with rationale. This is a descriptive simulation (not a forecasting model), all key methodology checks passed."
